{"version":1,"content":"<p>46歲的張栢芝吸金力向來驚人，私下更是圈中著名的頂級名牌手袋大收藏家，家中珍藏多款極難入手的限量版及稀有皮革款式。</p><p>近日，她在社交平台分享生活近況，隨身行頭再次引爆網民熱議。</p><p>相片中她一口氣換上兩款天價夢幻手袋，展現超強星味！</p><p>&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:25:38.838468+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:01:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:26.138152+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:26.138152+00:00","content_hash":"6be12d7ad2cbf775407abaf2cc86be0d9f6fd24abb58c5f8907c1e8bf126c9e8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}